{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e30cd7af0688a5f0e286939012fd15b28df29ed91c37bfafdab1eade47744fa9", "ja": "これまでを振り返った志保、可奈、星梨花、\n海美は、本当に沢山の人に助けられてきた\nのだと実感し、今日のライブでは少しでも\nお返ししようとステージに飛び出して、\n皆と一緒に満開の花を咲かせるのだった。", "zh": "回顾一路走来的志保、可奈、星梨花、  \n海美真切感受到自己一直以来得到了许多人的帮助，  \n于是她们在今天的演唱会上跃上舞台，想要多少回报大家一些，  \n和大家一起绽放出满开的花朵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1000_036kan", "source_sha256": "f71219c9a9a9ab777eb5a4051b96fd274ee7cdfe2429861068e523d3dcde43f2", "ja": "デビューライブの後も、色々あったよね。\n志保ちゃんに、また指導してもらったり。", "zh": "出道演出之后，也发生了各种各样的事呢。比如，又请志保指导我什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "39af01aaa82c344d1d4740c6c66670b9a53176372908f9967fa4d399ad38d144", "ja": "可奈は当分、歌の練習と勉強は禁止ね。\nなんでか、その理由が分かるまでね。", "zh": "可奈你暂时禁止练歌和学习。\n直到你想明白原因究竟是什么为止。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1002_036kan", "source_sha256": "bb1bc5986e5b6d3f32fe58c02ffd1b2d78cf2df332649e324bd0b4378bcb483a", "ja": "え……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1003_033sih", "source_sha256": "dc0597b4dec779ed36a5ca80f3a04877b6aac2442ba98b906fe38a6ec2d26fde", "ja": "あと、ヒーローショーの仕事もしたわね。海美さんや\n美也さん、劇場のみんなと一緒に取り組んで。", "zh": "还有，也接过英雄秀的工作呢。和海美小姐、\n美也小姐，还有剧场的大家一起努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "8c346d1267dfaebd80d7330f54cec49843758e4048c1598baa9b86fb790db8cb", "ja": "私ね、『Clover』のお姉ちゃんとしてしっかり\nしなきゃ、女子力つけなきゃって思ってたけど……", "zh": "我本来想着，作为『Clover』的姐姐得好好表现才行，还得提升自己的女性魅力才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "d5ddd6d266d2cd629293f05980c3345cd5a7c8f2d2fdadbc1a0305e27845b9e9", "ja": "急に変わるのは難しいかも……。それとね、私は\nやっぱりみんなで何かをするのが好きみたいなんだ。", "zh": "想要一下子改变可能很难……而且啊，我果然\n还是喜欢和大家一起做些什么呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "02e824e9290aae76a5a7e9005f0b4de5b2fda8fed267a6db3be780855fa5ce0f", "ja": "だから……また……失敗しちゃうかもだけど。\nこれからもみんなの力、借りてもいい？", "zh": "所以……之后……可能还是会失败。\n今后也可以继续借助大家的力量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "fb7115a13cde8030a69a1d13e530ee18b19e967361438177ca33b323184633f4", "ja": "あとあと、みんなで北海道にも行ったよね！", "zh": "后来后来，我们还一起去北海道了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "e7749755126ebcb421d3b6cb41f656684d6d0815a296a8b8285074d0d6c31528", "ja": "「みんな、無事北海道に着きましたか？\n志保の母です」", "zh": "“大家平安到达北海道了吗？\n我是志保的妈妈”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "ef9dafe139381ba324a090931a9712104553a949f638a4f0e0f0c3ae5cf7d4fb", "ja": "お母……さん？", "zh": "妈妈……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "f4c330fc8b09949ef3f97c04e50e77f07e1910fe557264e7a2c34361813042d1", "ja": "「私が言っても聞いてくれないので星梨花ちゃんに\nメールしました。それでお願いなんだけど……」", "zh": "“我说的话她也不听，所以才发邮件\n给星梨花你。然后，我想拜托你的是……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "d6d12e6f74a5af532110930a693c2044fd85a8ad7ecff9935e1e5008d8cbf36e", "ja": "海美さん、その話は別にいいと思うんですけど。\nもっと、ひなたとかエミリーとか……。", "zh": "海美姐，那个话题倒是无所谓，不过……\n还有小日向、艾米莉之类的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "cdbd042c75960f00ff4e15a53c99cfd8cb53b06435d25b8ac69322185164852b", "ja": "志保さんのお母さん、\nとってもとっても優しい人ですよね♪", "zh": "志保的妈妈，\n是个非常非常温柔的人呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "4fc5d34d25ed4ba3744bfbb2de91b47e378e76d0d98d71e41a12e1a557b3ff3d", "ja": "星梨花まで……。もちろん、優しい人だけど。", "zh": "连星梨花也……她当然是个温柔的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1014_036kan", "source_sha256": "35a1c0db76ace67c58955f84c2df62243d4196f322fc749d75ad61fdd03ebde7", "ja": "……いろんな人と出会って。私たち、本当に、\n沢山の人に助けてもらってきたよね。", "zh": "……遇到了形形色色的人。我们真的，一直都受到许多人的帮助呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1015_022ser", "source_sha256": "a73f78583de41a0ac2beaa1a81245704e4c8a4ce8df441b51ea49a1979ea3c18", "ja": "劇場のみんなに、ファンのみなさん、共演者さんに、\nスタッフのみなさん、パパ、ママ……。", "zh": "剧场的大家、各位粉丝、共演者、工作人员，还有爸爸、妈妈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "b53059d99f2541cd801d53969e92314391de6afec057d7ee5e84be1da5a0e264", "ja": "うちのお姉ちゃん、りっくん、かなりんのお友達！\nみんなに、大大大・大感謝！だよね☆", "zh": "我姐姐、里库、加奈琳的朋友们！要对大家献上大大大、大大的感谢！对吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "a6260fb4511b0c6d2983b7540c0b2d151540ff5a26d0a256216b4f17b93cc10e", "ja": "今日のライブで、少しでもそのお返しをしましょう！", "zh": "就用今天的演出，稍微回报一下大家吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1018_405bcp", "source_sha256": "0f3913d813dac38c56e9a5332b471764ab5067833764337a33131b798fe0a216", "ja": "お返しか……。それはどうかな。", "zh": "回礼啊……这可不好说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "b53525ae41378e421f53f2afcef70f10f4127ccba3a71f4a993576d8594f015f", "ja": "えっ。どうかなって……。\nお返し、しない方がいいってことですか？", "zh": "咦。什么叫“那可不好说”……  \n你的意思是，不回礼比较好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1020_405bcp", "source_sha256": "418ffc971cb1c38a8d0c777d5fb40fa30bad3c013540ff0fd84f91bec21e558c", "ja": "いや、してもいいけど。\n客席のみんなが待ってるのは、たぶん……。", "zh": "倒也不是不行。\n不过观众席的大家在等待的，大概是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1021_405bcp", "source_sha256": "c9150e89d4359139902e7a362c7d966ad46fbea873dceb684102f1f3f870406c", "ja": "Cloverの掛け声みたいなことじゃ\nないかと思ってな。", "zh": "我觉得他们等待的，大概是\n类似于Clover的口号那样的东西吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "ff82ae80985d813b9a5389d54add88aaa8e8951d7b63c4ab8737a96417c7616b", "ja": "私たちの掛け声みたいな……？", "zh": "像我们的口号一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1023_022ser", "source_sha256": "72f4c11c79a945925c2d4cf5c3303ec56af830fb445785fe2b00c15db2b536c1", "ja": "あなたのとなりに……。あ。", "zh": "在你的身边……啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1024_036kan", "source_sha256": "f30419a6cfdc7db6a5394741a48881be64570cf609b6d8c3cfc2de3b1f249b63", "ja": "そっか～！", "zh": "原来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "f30419a6cfdc7db6a5394741a48881be64570cf609b6d8c3cfc2de3b1f249b63", "ja": "そっか～！", "zh": "原来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "7e52f54a1be4a0d685d6c8fbb6b72355bc1eb771829986410651aa8b542ba9f0", "ja": "そっか……。", "zh": "这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1027_022ser", "source_sha256": "856c219717fa7292b0a74b638a9396145181768e90dfc715e00f59fd93609560", "ja": "そうですね！", "zh": "没错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1028_null", "source_sha256": "a643276fac463f5e06ddf29dab1f31b8e2c7f7bb284470f7983baf09f788ee39", "ja": "そして……。", "zh": "接着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1029_audience", "source_sha256": "c66d90df1cd8c6f01308982fb102388c2229c9269de84580215976b592c4e0fc", "ja": "ワアアアァァァッ！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1030_405bcp", "source_sha256": "ff3c3d13fd28905c6a45422b813a6b2c4624bd6edf4448b8aa5c0331e765d138", "ja": "そういうことだ。さて、そろそろ開演時間だな。\n今日のライブ、全力で楽しんで……", "zh": "就是这么回事。好了，也差不多到开演时间了。今天的演出，要尽情享受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0335_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_06_1031_405bcp", "source_sha256": "b36b964f32197ca9d419c0131a00eed8ba95652dee8aa5347c99d7cfc1af139c", "ja": "みんなと一緒に、満開の花を咲かせてきてくれ！", "zh": "去和大家一起，让花朵盛开绽放吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
